WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.170
- [Narrator] The monsoon
season means one big thing

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.263
in India's southern state of Kerala,

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.793
it's snake boat season and
that means building and racing.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:17.083
This great big story is
inspired by, Genesis.

00:00:28.421 --> 00:00:31.150
With a history dating
back nearly 400 years,

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:34.163
the snake boat is a
traditional war boat in Kerala.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:38.170
Measuring up to 120 feet in length,

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.310
these are intricate and not surprisingly,

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.393
complicated to construct.

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:07.180
(upbeat music)

00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:12.250
- [Narrator] Today, snake
boats aren't used for warfare,

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.960
their used for racing

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:17.500
and in the Aranmula festival,
the boats are extremely ornate

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.167
and can take months to complete.

00:01:43.654 --> 00:01:45.987
(hammering)

00:01:50.887 --> 00:01:51.740
- [Narrator] Because of the boat's shape,

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:55.407
they have a peculiar
method of construction.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:10.070
- [Narrator] With knowledge
passed down from generation

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:13.830
to generation, these artisans
are not here for the pay.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:16.320
They are instead here for
the privilege of crafting

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.323
these works of art.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:20.960
As the boats are thrust into the water,

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:24.610
they are boarded by four
helmsmen, up to 100 oarsmen

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.030
and a few singers who are
there to help maintain

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.437
the rhythm orf rowing.

00:02:28.437 --> 00:02:30.604
(singing)

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.600
- [Narrator] It is only at
this point that Santhosh

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.667
and his men can rest easy.

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:41.667
- [Santhosh] (foreign language)

